# Rickety Gazebo: "When you unlock this door, mill four cards, then return up to two permanent cards from among them to
# your hand" (CR 701.17a, 608.2d). Bot1 casts the Gazebo, so it unlocks as the Room enters and triggers (CR 709.5d,
# 709.5h): Memnite, Lightning Bolt, Ornithopter and Plains are milled, and Bot1 returns Memnite and Ornithopter (Lightning
# Bolt is no permanent card, and all three permanent cards are refused: up to two). Greenhouse is locked, so Bot1's Plains taps only for {W} and
# Unsummon can't be cast. In turn 3 Bot1 unlocks Greenhouse: "Lands you control have '{T}: Add one mana of any color'"
# (layer 6) applies at once (CR 709.5), and the Plains pays Unsummon's {U}. Bot2's Island gains nothing ("you control").

