Forest
Black Lotus
Greenhouse // Rickety Gazebo
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Unsummon
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains
Plains x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

